   "speech": "“Unbelievable?” he exclaimed. “But what if I show you such a prospect: you, yes, you, Doctor, all at once, suddenly, sitting in that armchair, remember that there is infinite space?.. Very well, sir… But you think of it with walls, don’t you — you put walls around that space in your mind! And suddenly there is nothing for you, no walls, and you feel with all the cold of your heart what sort of thing it is — space! Only a single instant, yes, sir, but that very instant can lay you out dead, because you are — not fitted for it!..”",
